\section*{Reproducibility Declaration}
All results are reproducible using:
\begin{itemize}
    \item SPICE kernels: \texttt{sat441.bsp}, \texttt{pck00010.tpc}
    \item Radial binning: $\Delta r = 1\ \mathrm{km}$, Saturnocentric J2000
    \item Cassini UVIS/VIMS occultation datasets (e.g., $\gamma$ Crucis, Rev 089)
    \item Tensor equations provided in the manuscript
    \item Fixed ablation parameters for Run A and Run B
\end{itemize}

Floating-point determinism is guaranteed across multi-node GPU clusters.

